OL,3,AZelensky says airlines should avoid
OL,4,ARussian airspace as Ukraine escalates
OL,5,Adrone operations
OL,6,
OL,7,FRussian President Vladimir Putin said
OL,8,Fthe comments amounted to a "declaration
OL,9,Fof state terrorism".
OL,11,FMost Western commercial airlines do not
OL,12,Ffly over Russia because of the ongoing
OL,13,FRussian invasion of Ukraine, but
OL,14,Fcarriers in countries like Turkey and
OL,15,FChina do.
